#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:10002
#: 64bd71a173c642d693bcb2ff268a32c7
msgid "Case Study: Seismic Analysis with ObsPy"
msgstr "ケーススタディ: ObsPy 連携による地震データ解析"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:10004
#: 52949aaed7fb4268bbad0737d8bc4f48
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates how to read seismological data in **MiniSEED /"
" SAC / FDSN** formats and analyze it using gwexpy, with seamless "
"conversion between `obspy` and gwexpy objects."
msgstr ""
"このチュートリアルでは **MiniSEED / SAC / FDSN** 形式の地震データを読み込み、gwexpy "
"で解析する方法と、`obspy` ↔ gwexpy 間の双方向変換を解説します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:10006
#: 558d3bdaacfe4e009d0784427ce1d3cc
msgid "Use cases in GW detector science"
msgstr "重力波検出器科学での用途"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:10007
#: d03fc0f8b1de4a7e8291bc714ed253ca
msgid "Reading seismometer data from KAGRA, LIGO, or Virgo environment monitors"
msgstr "KAGRA・LIGO・Virgo 環境モニターの地震計データ読み込み"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:10008
#: 318c0847c9234179b57655a42534f797
msgid "Seismic noise analysis and coupling to detector sensitivity"
msgstr "地震ノイズ解析と検出器感度へのカップリング"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:10009
#: b5de8870694949ae92c5644b8ca8db0f
msgid "Cross-correlation of seismic channels with gravitational-wave data"
msgstr "地震チャンネルと重力波データのクロス相関"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:10011
#: f7f5de3273b14c9796d29bd9663e9813
msgid ""
"**Legacy migration note:**   If your code used `obspy.read()` directly "
"followed by manual numpy processing, replace it with "
"`TimeSeries.read(format='miniseed')` and gwexpy's high-level signal "
"processing methods.   See the [Interop / Conversion Guide](../interop.md)"
" and [Interop API reference](../../reference/api/interop) for the current"
" public interop surface."
msgstr ""
"**レガシー移行に関する注記：**   コードが `obspy.read()` を直接呼び出し、その後に手動の numpy "
"処理を行っていた場合は、`TimeSeries.read(format='miniseed')` と gwexpy "
"の高水準な信号処理メソッドに置き換えてください。   現在の公開 interop インターフェースについては [Interop / "
"変換ガイド](../interop.md) および [Interop API "
"リファレンス](../../reference/api/interop) を参照してください。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:30002
#: fdc07b4530dd41b4aa4f4fe7dddf704d
msgid "1. Route 1: `TimeSeries.read(format='miniseed')`"
msgstr "1\\. ルート 1: `TimeSeries.read(format='miniseed')`"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:30004
#: f6280a6050274595b5727732b6c69c32
msgid ""
"gwexpy's I/O layer supports reading MiniSEED files directly, returning a "
"`TimeSeries` object with correct units and time axis."
msgstr "gwexpy の I/O レイヤーは MiniSEED ファイルを直接読み込み、正しい単位と時間軸を持つ `TimeSeries` を返します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:50002
#: 9f9b6b7436104e5a8a2169ecedabd1d0
msgid "2. Route 2: `from_obspy_trace()` – Convert from obspy objects"
msgstr "2\\. ルート 2: `from_obspy_trace()` – obspy オブジェクトから変換"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:50004
#: 9546dcc4f20e423487f15a7ff5aad859
msgid ""
"If you already have an `obspy.Trace` or `obspy.Stream`, convert it to "
"gwexpy with `from_obspy_trace()`."
msgstr ""
"すでに `obspy.Trace` / `obspy.Stream` がある場合は `from_obspy_trace()` で gwexpy "
"に変換します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:70002
#: bb528479ae2249c1818e565cf159501f
msgid "3. Signal Processing on Seismic Data"
msgstr "3\\. 地震データの信号処理"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:70004
#: a05b7cd61b7d481782a2db3be7ee2f97
msgid ""
"Once converted to `TimeSeries`, all gwexpy signal processing methods are "
"available."
msgstr "`TimeSeries` に変換すると、gwexpy のすべての信号処理メソッドが利用可能になります。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:120002
#: 8d373eaf04ee4b2fbdfbfcff72c5f2da
msgid "4. Convert Back to obspy"
msgstr "4\\. obspy に戻す変換"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:120004
#: 1b00232510d443f99b96b34aa7d08550
msgid ""
"After gwexpy processing, convert the result back to obspy for further "
"seismological analysis (e.g., instrument response removal, FDSN upload)."
msgstr "gwexpy での処理後、さらなる地震学的解析（例：装置応答の除去、FDSN へのアップロード）のために、結果を obspy に戻すことができます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:140002
#: e34492e5453241e28c21fa239e9a0d5e
msgid "5. Multi-channel Seismic Analysis"
msgstr "5\\. マルチチャンネル地震解析"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:140004
#: 6517ff32345742f5afa370c12c7bc5fa
msgid ""
"When you have multiple seismic channels (3-component seismometer: X, Y, "
"Z), use `TimeSeriesMatrix` for batch processing."
msgstr "3 成分地震計（X, Y, Z）のように複数チャネルを同時に扱う場合は、`TimeSeriesMatrix` を使うと一括処理できます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_seismic_obspy.ipynb:160002
